One more consideration on controls: the strict duplicate-key YAML check. Use yaml.compose and walk MappingNode to detect duplicate keys. Implement:

```
def dup_keys(node, path=''):
    out=[]
    if isinstance(node, yaml.MappingNode):
        seen={}
        for k,v in node.value:
            key=k.value
            if key in seen: out.append(f'{path}.{key}' if path else key)
            else: seen[key]=v
            out+=dup_keys(v, f'{path}.{key}' if path else key)
    elif isinstance(node, yaml.SequenceNode):
        for i,v in enumerate(node.value): out+=dup_keys(v, f'{path}[{i}]')
    return out
```

